WJ1000115","city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[47,19,80,71,75,82],"title":28,"rank":"3","loyalty":"99","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1026305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1031","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[47,19,80,71,75,82],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1026305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10104","city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[47,19,80,71,75,82],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1026305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"曹魏官员，大将军曹爽的主簿，以忠心事主、临危死谏的形象在史册中留下悲壮一笔。因曹爽昏聩，杨综多次谏言而未果，导致曹魏政局落入司马氏之手。高平陵之变后，司马懿因其尽忠职守而赦免，成语“各为其主”亦由此出。司马懿又任命杨综为安东参军，后为安东将军司马昭的长史。此后，杨综还担任过御史中丞、并州刺史等职。","tc":"曹魏官員，大將軍曹爽的主簿，以忠心事主、臨危死諫的形象在史冊中留下悲壯一筆。因曹爽昏聵，楊綜多次諫言而未果，導致曹魏政局落入司馬氏之手。高平陵之變后，司馬懿因其盡忠職守而赦免，成語“各為其主”亦由此出。司馬懿又任命楊綜為安東參軍，后為安東將軍司馬昭的長史。此后，楊綜還擔任過御史中丞、并州刺史等職。","en":"An official of Cao Wei and Registrar under General-in-Chief Cao Shuang, remembered in history for his tragic loyalty and perilous remonstrances. Because of Cao Shuang's incompetence, Yang Zong's repeated warnings went unheeded, leading to Cao Wei's governance falling into the hands of the Sima clan. Following the Gaoping Tombs Incident, Sima Yi pardoned him in recognition of his steadfast devotion to duty, giving rise to the idiom ‘each serves their own master.’ Sima Yi then appointed Yang Zong as Army Advisor to the General Who Pacifies the East, and he later served as Chief Clerk to General Who Pacifies the East Sima Zhao. He subsequently held offices including Palace Assistant Imperial Censor and Inspector of Bing Province.","jp":"曹魏の官吏であり、大将軍・曹爽の主簿を務めた。主に忠誠を尽くし、危難に際して命を賭して諫言した姿は、史書に悲壮な一筆として残されている。曹爽が暗愚であったため、楊綜は度重なる諫言を行ったものの容れられず、曹魏の政局は司馬氏の手に落ちることとなった。高平陵の変の後、司馬懿はその職務に忠を尽くした姿勢を評価して赦免し、故事成語「各為其主（各々その主の為にす）」の由来ともなった。さらに司馬懿によって安東参軍に任命され、後に安東将軍・司馬昭の長史となった。その後も、楊綜は御史中丞や并州刺史などの官職を歴任した。","kr":"조위의 관료이자 대장군 조상의 주부로, 주군을 향한 충성과 위기 속에서도 목숨을 걸고 간언한 모습으로 사서에 비장한 한 획을 남겼다. 조상이 우매하여 양종이 수차례 간언했으나 받아들여지지 않았고, 결국 조위의 정국은 사마씨의 손에 넘어가게 되었다. 고평릉의 변 이후 사마의는 그가 직분에 충성을 다했던 점을 높이 사 사면하였는데, 고사성어 '각위기주(各爲其主)' 역시 여기서 유래하였다. 사마의는 양종을 안동참군으로 삼았으며, 이후 그는 안동장군 사마소의 장사가 되었다. 훗날 양종은 어사중승, 병주자사 등의 관직을 역임했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1029115","remark":"","surname":"杨","surnameTc":"楊","surnameEn":"Yang","surnameJp":"楊","surnameKr":"양","surnameOther":"","name":"综","nameTc":"綜","nameEn":"Zong","nameJp":"綜","nameKr":"종","nameOther":"","word":"初伯","wordTc":"初伯","wordEn":"Chubo","wordJp":"初伯","wordKr":"초백","wordOther":"","icon":"杨综","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"218","city":"CS1031","gender":"0","rule":"47","force":"19","wise":"80","politics":"71","charm":"75","will":"82","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"5/5/5/51/5/49/50/5","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1003305","warSoulPoint":"1300","battleSoulPoint":"300","debateSoulPoint":"5600","strategy":"1004408","strategy2":"1002105","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/0/1/2/2/2/1/0/1/0/1/0/3/3/2/0/0/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"7","compatible":"14","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","evaluate":"-3000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"201","show":"218","death":"259","age":"0","injury"